/v/t64.5771-25/38974504_999332164037048_8352848161181583365_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TTD1ZWzzy9gQ7kNvwFx-6ic&_nc_oc=AdrHM9oSri_M26BscEgf8QbKli-JiotriBE5rkMhKNPar9v6R0X8weSHgXCXSP4vUzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Yj6lcATp2mYlHV9Y-eOugdI4nj7Q6J3YaCUx5PnipvA&oe=6A258779"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom2.png", "id": "1060903411489141", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031501_1060903414822474_9192607785681237416_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FHvkn9Nr4tIQ7kNvwExKEa8&_nc_oc=AdqN3IvZeo1Gf98VBWmbUZgVqVtP1OpV4mjJj7uJohAJHPZB8xfucO6kAhRBWPXvQ3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_RMi2yXfoxM2AbaCVkwV_53_gF4Kv-0sJ4vMaGgZorsA&oe=6A259903"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom3.png", "id": "1333559243720099", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1333559247053432_5526570972152141129_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rTOdKWdR5TEQ7kNvwGbhUng&_nc_oc=AdrWKQiHs6sJMi0FDCaoVQk550fNwME17BZMD4yXllozuCqXwN06bmSwZNNJ_3UpzfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8uGO-pGyvhw6Oyr0YtvjXtRLRUEUetuskhPysgVzDlBw&oe=6A258FCE"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom4.png", "id": "403819987828479", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_403819991161812_8720327022213224385_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_HkEgUTzsRYQ7kNvwGlIHzh&_nc_oc=Adr0I4NTd9vbvEsfgr8w_XWElm47_C4Ex_XCGWOb57cl4Q9oeOfSPUnw1nS2Oua4rYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8N9wqbxRd-V_EMj_SoT6SOoWI5butvRbocfy-tIGqdvQ&oe=6A2597F3"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1BGLTwZCdNcQ7kNvwFOErGV&_nc_oc=AdrfG_eXtl4gYJdZ3-aUFXAuCN6u4dFWZbrsEH-6WYl-Um7CPS6t-KclrXBWzFpH3fY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8l4wiUQm_hoN1sP55aA7IYjwLu3cKOyM0OVvJmYNeI2A&oe=6A25913B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_name": "SQLearn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sqlearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The consortium of the VR-ME project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-me.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating":